<title>USA: Wyndham Hotel says names Les Bentley COO.</title>
<headline>Wyndham Hotel says names Les Bentley COO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wyndham Hotel Corp said Monday Les Bentley was promoted to the newly-created position of chief operations officer.</p>
<p>The company said Bentley had previously been president of its garden division.</p>
<p>The company said the promotion is part of the effort to combine with Patriot American Hospitality Inc. The company announced in April a merger agreement with Patriot.</p>
